    Bug 2043654 - Change IExchangeClient::DeleteFolder to take a single folder ID. r=jtracey,edicharry


    While working through this, I realised EmptyFolder also has the same issue.

    I kept EWS's `DoEraseFolder` with a vec of IDs since it makes fallback easier if
    EmptyFolder isn't available - although I guess at this point we could probably
    easily split EmptyFolder and DeleteFolder and simplify this even further by
    removing the `EraseFolder` trait. I'll let the reviewer decide if I should go
    down that route as well.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D303397

